        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7503, Brushed Stainless Steel Round Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary round stainless steel cup pull from Omnia hardware is resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches, and abrasions. It features a warm brushed stainless steel finish. It is pressure mounted into the door for a screw-less installation. he Brushed Stainless Steel Round Cup Pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, sliding barn doors, or cabinet doors. Use on any lightweight or sliding door where a flush with the door face pull is desired. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/century-solid-brass-round-flush-pull-omnia-7503-52\"><b>Solid Brass Round Cup Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-square-cup-pull-omnia-7504-52\"><b>Stainless Steel Square Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 7503/52-US32D Stainless Round Flush Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: .050\" Thick Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
